      "role": "user",
      "content": "is it even possible for a massive project like the Protocol X codebase to have been written by one person while the public thinks it was a whole team? i keep looking at the original commits and the logic is too consistent... it feels like they're just using the dev team as a shield to keep the actual architect out of the spotlight.",
